Package: VISTA
Type: Package
Title: Visualization and Integrated System for Transcriptomic Analysis
Version: 1.1.7
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Chirag", family = "Parsania", email = "chirag.parsania@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4873-2385"))
  )
Description: VISTA (Visualization and Integrated System for Transcriptomic
    Analysis) runs bulk RNA-seq differential expression with DESeq2, edgeR or
    limma-voom, or a DESeq2/edgeR consensus, and keeps counts, results for every
    contrast, gene annotation, colours and analysis parameters in one validated
    SummarizedExperiment-derived object. Plotting functions, GO, KEGG and MSigDB
    enrichment, optional cell-type deconvolution and a Quarto report all read
    that object, and an exported benchmark checks its results against
    independent DESeq2, edgeR and limma runs.
